Our methodology builds upon the foundational work of \citet{baldi2017learning}, who introduced a layered VAE architecture for variational inference. Additionally, our approach aligns with the definition of layer groups presented by \citet{neumann2019crystallographicgroups}, who developed an embedding for layers groups derived from a crystal structure database.

